    <briefdescription>
<para>Structured diagnostic event. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Captures operational telemetry from field deployments for analysis and debugging. All string fields should be sanitized before emission to prevent PII leaks.</para>
<para>Example usage: <programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal">DiagnosticEvent<sp/>evt{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.timestamp<sp/>=<sp/>std::chrono::system_clock::now(),</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.failure_category<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1observability_1aaae27066c203328c7cbe7ed960797b07a8842eef2fb460ac2c6c7a1cd320be72d" kindref="member">DiagnosticFailureCategory::NLI_INFERENCE</ref>,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.module_name<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;rag&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.error_message<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;ONNX<sp/>model<sp/>inference<sp/>failed&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.severity_level<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1observability_1aad859bd0fd97c664175b51448043b2d1abb1ca97ec761fc37101737ba0aa2e7c5" kindref="member">DiagnosticSeverity::ERROR</ref>,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.deployment_environment<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;production&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.version<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;1.5.0&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.stacktrace_hash<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;abc123def456&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">};</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
